ions</cell><cell>new tab</cell><cell>Open a new tab</cell></row><row><cell></cell><cell>tab close</cell><cell>Close current tab</cell></row><row><cell></cell><cell>go back</cell><cell>Visit the last URL</cell></row><row><cell>Page Operations</cell><cell>go forward goto</cell><cell>Undo go back Go to URL</cell></row><row><cell></cell><cell>go home 7</cell><cell></cell></row></table></figure>\n<figure xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" type=\"table\" xml:id=\"tab_7\"><head>Table 9 :</head><label>9</label><figDesc>Performance comparison between Agent-E success rate (SR) and AgentOccam SR on tasks defined on real-world web environments from WebVoyager<ref type=\"bibr\" target=\"#b7\">(He et al., 2024)</ref>.</figDesc><table><row><cell>Website (Task Number)</cell><cell>Agent-E SR</cell><cell>AgentOccam SR</cell></row><row><cell>Allrecipes (4)</cell><cell>75.00%</cell><cell>50.00%</cell></row><row><cell>Amazon (1)</cell><cell>0.00%</cell><cell>0.00%</cell></row><row><cell>Apple (7)</cell><cell>57.14%</cell><cell>28.57%</cell></row><row><cell>ArXiv (16)</cell><cell>50.00%</cell><cell>43.75%</cell></row><row><cell>BBC News (2)</cell><cell>0.00%</cell><cell>0.00%</cell></row><row><cell>Booking (2)</cell><cell>50.00%</cell><cell>100.00%</cell></row><row><cell>Cambridge Dictionary (9)</cell><cell>55.56%</cell><cell>88.89%</cell></row><row><cell>Coursera (2)</cell><cell>50.00%</cell><cell>50.00%</cell></row><row><cell>ESPN (10)</cell><cell>40.00%</cell><cell>50.00%</cell></row><row><cell>Google Map (9)</cell><cell>33.33%</cell><cell>44.44%</cell></row><row><cell>Google Search (16)</cell><cell>62.50%</cell><cell>81.25%</cell></row><row><cell>Huggingface (17)</cell><cell>17.65%</cell><cell>29.41%</cell></row><row><cell>Wolfram Alpha (34)</cell><cell>73.53%</cell><cell>61.76%</cell></row><row><cell>Overall (129)</cell><cell>51.90%</cell><cell>54.30%</cell></row></table></figure>\n<figure xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" type=\"table\" xml:id=\"tab_8\"><head>Table 10 :</hea